#20300
Gnolls of the Black Fang~
    I made this area as a place for low to mid level players to gain
experience.  It will also be a good place for characters to work on
their alignment...much like the elven village, only opposite.  The
Gnolls are of evil align., where the elves are good...other than that
the two areas are very much alike, ie. HP's of mobs, EQ in the area,
experience points for mobs, etc.

Reference materials for this area include the elven village, the D&D
Rules Cyclopedia, and Maelstrom.

Smythe
Summer 1995
~
203 0 0 0 0 0
S
