#20309
Lodge of the Gnoll Weapon Master~
    The walls of this lodge are covered with some really disgusting
furs.  Since Gnolls are too stupid and/or lazy to craft their own metal
weapons, they have to steal them.  The job of the weapon master is to
make sure that everyone is equipped and that the weapons that they do
have are maintained.
~
